### API details
Base URL: `https://api.openalex.org/works`
Polite pool (10 req/s): send `mailto:YOUR_EMAIL` in User-Agent header
No auth needed for basic use (free API key available but optional)

### Lookup by OpenAlex ID or DOI
```
GET /works/W2031190677          # by OpenAlex ID
GET /works/doi:10.xxxx/yyyy     # by DOI
```
Both return the same full work object.

### Search
```
GET /works?search=TITLE&per_page=5&select=id,display_name,authorships,publication_year,relevance_score,doi
```

### Batch resolve OpenAlex IDs → full records (for referenced_works)
```
GET /works?filter=openalex:W123|W456|W789&per_page=50&select=id,doi
```
Up to 50 IDs per call using pipe-separated values.

